{"id":"vod_sn_37605","vodId":"37605","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"少年阴阳师","name_cn":"少年阴阳师","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ff2535e6211c9dfdb7b092a849df47c9.jpg"},"summary":"13岁的安倍昌浩（甲斐田雪 配音），是日本最伟大的阴阳师安倍晴明的孙子，作为晴明唯一继承者的他却没有什么法力——他不能看见妖怪。当他想放弃阴阳师之路，努力培养别的才能时，一直形似白猫的神秘小妖怪出现在他身边。与此同时，京都妖孽横行，于是爷爷委托昌浩去击退妖魔。没有法力的昌浩只好带着这只小猫怪，作为自己“看见妖怪”的眼睛。几番恶斗后，昌浩击退了肆虐于京都里的妖魔，并恢复了多年前被封印的法力。同时，他也得知，原来那只小猫怪，是爷爷安培晴明的式神——腾蛇红莲。　　虽然恢复了法力，昌浩作为阴阳师还十分稚嫩。于是他立下宏愿，发誓要超越爷爷，成为最强的阴阳师。他和同伴腾蛇红莲一起，走上了修行之路……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BYEfTUnbiB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M01uhmt1PJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H9y4iM2rnH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WyiGWpYhTW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/92HYPsetiS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CuBFRuu9yT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sP20dCQW0M1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/maG4ET2FQQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RSsK2Qtv4N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UkcTTtgMdU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pSSKXZgfgn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YZPZZkbLqE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qE8s5CtjKJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qftaWnNMzm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"n